e  i love this city what is happening now  is like seeing your relative dying in  your hands you see as their organs stop  working one by one their eyes getting  dark while you hold them in your hands  mario paul is a city completely  surrounded now  and there's a cold brutality to the  russian tactics here  and that is to destroy everything  raising mario paul to the ground  and crushing the will of its people  nick martin sky news ukraine
 

